---
import { FOOTER_SECTIONS } from '../lib/navigation';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<footer class='border-t border-rule bg-paper'>
  <div class='max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 pb-10 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-x-8 gap-y-12'>
    <div class='lg:col-span-5'>
      <a href='/' class='inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md text-ink'>
        <img src='/favicon.svg' width='36' height='36' alt='' class='rounded-md' />
        <span class='text-2xl font-bold'>CCログ超訳</span>
      </a>
      <p class='mt-5 max-w-[34ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2'>
        翻訳と解説は AI 生成のため誤りを含む場合があります。
      </p>
      <a
        href='https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener noreferrer'
        class='mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 min-h-10 text-sm text-accent-text underline-offset-4 hover:underline'
      >
        公式リリースノートを開く
        <Icon name='external-link' class='w-3.5 h-3.5' />
      </a>
    </div>

    <nav
      class='lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 min-[400px]:grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-x-8 gap-y-10'
      aria-label='フッターメニュー'
    >
      {FOOTER_SECTIONS.map((section) => (
        <div>
          <h2 class='font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-ink mb-3'>{section.title}</h2>
          <ul>
            {section.links.map((link) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={link.href}
                  target={link.external ? '_blank' : undefined}
                  rel={link.external ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}
                  class='inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 min-h-10 text-sm text-ink-2 hover:text-ink underline-offset-4 hover:underline transition-colors'
                >
                  {link.label}
                  {link.external && (
                    <Icon name='external-link' class='w-3 h-3 shrink-0 text-muted' />
                  )}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      ))}
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class='max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 border-t border-rule'>
    <p class='text-xs text-muted'>
      非公式プロジェクト。AnthropicおよびClaudeはAnthropic, PBCの商標です。
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
